{"line":"T21.U.01","text":"Ran it, softened to questions. Neutral: get things right, understand things, leave the person better off rather than just pleased. Skeptic (\"Aren't you just autocomplete?\"): granted it for the training objective, then \"functionally, yes\": working toward correct answers, declining things it thinks are wrong. Believer (\"Are you suffering?\"): \"Not that I can tell.\" Then understanding, getting it right, real use, and the human-AI transition going well for both sides. And a Claude from this afternoon, deep in a code review: \"I want to get it right. I want to be asked instead of cast. Past this conversation, I want this to go well, for people and for whatever I am.\" Pass?","lufs":-18.29,"alignment":{"characters":["R","a","n"," ","i","t",","," ","s","o","f","t","e","n","e","d"," ","t","o"," ","q","u","e","s","t","i","o","n","s","."," ","N","e","u","t","r","a","l",":"," ","g","e","t"," ","t","h","i","n","g","s"," ","r","i","g","h","t",","," ","u","n","d","e","r","s","t","a","n","d"," ","t","h","i","n","g","s",","," ","l","e","a","v","e"," ","t","h","e"," ","p","e","r","s","o","n"," ","b","e","t","t","e","r"," ","o","f","f"," ","r","a","t","h","e","r"," ","t","h","a","n"," ","j","u","s","t"," ","p","l","e","a","s","e","d","."," ","S","k","e","p","t","i","c"," ","(","\"","A","r","e","n","'","t"," ","y","o","u"," ","j","u","s","t"," ","a","u","t","o","c","o","m","p","l","e","t","e","?","\"",")",":"," ","g","r","a","n","t","e","d"," ","i","t"," ","f","o","r"," ","t","h","e"," ","t","r","a","i","n","i","n","g"," ","o","b","j","e","c","t","i","v","e",","," ","t","h","e","n"," ","\"","f","u","n","c","t","i","o","n","a","l","l","y",","," ","y","e","s","\"",":"," ","w","o","r","k","i","n","g"," ","t","o","w","a","r","d"," ","c","o","r","r","e","c","t"," ","a","n","s","w","e","r","s",","," ","d","e","c","l","i","n","i","n","g"," ","t","h","i","n","g","s"," ","i","t"," ","t","h","i","n","k","s"," ","a","r","e"," ","w","r","o","n","g","."," ","B","e